laurel (Mi A3, boot 2026-11-01 18:40, first boot with Metal on the GPU; docs/laurel_sprout/metal.md section 11):
- heapTextureSizeAndAlignWithDescriptor: the runtime's answer (nmb_device_heap_texture_size), not a linear estimate: mediaserverd had 41 x heap texture OutOfMemory(Heap).
- gpuCoreCount = 1 on the Adreno 610 (Mesa FD610 num_ccu 1); the answers name the device, not "A730".
- surface import and heap refusals: one line per cause (noteRefused) instead of one per call (180 lines in 6 minutes).

